{"id":18479,"date":"2023-11-28T01:36:26","date_gmt":"2023-11-28T01:36:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18479"},"modified":"2023-11-28T01:36:44","modified_gmt":"2023-11-28T01:36:44","slug":"damien-f","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/damien-f\/","title":{"rendered":"DAMIEN F."},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-18481\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Damien-Faulkner-Profile-2-300x300-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>Hailing from the vibrant coastal city of Virginia Beach, VA, meet the one and only DJ Damien. This musical virtuoso thrives on the electrifying energy of a lively crowd when he\u2019s on the decks. He\u2019s not just a DJ; he\u2019s a conductor of good times, making every event an unforgettable experience.<\/p>\n<p>With a diverse range of interests, Damien is your go-to maestro for Car Shows, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/corporate-gamespartiestrivia\/\">Corporate events<\/a>, and Weddings. His musical palette knows no boundaries, from the pulsating beats of Pop to the lyrical flow of Hip Hop. He doesn\u2019t just play the music; he feels it, and he ensures you do too.<\/p>\n<p>Damien\u2019s passion for music doesn\u2019t stop at mixing tracks; he\u2019s musically inclined and also a percussion maestro, effortlessly hitting the drums to create rhythm that resonates deep within your soul.<\/p>\n<p>What truly sets Damien apart is his inclusivity. When he\u2019s behind the turntables, he\u2019s not just a DJ; he\u2019s your musical genie. He strives to fulfill as many requests as possible, making sure that everyone in attendance is grooving to their favorite tunes. He\u2019s the conductor of your personal soundtrack, tailoring the beats to your desires.<\/p>\n<p>When he\u2019s not igniting dance floors, Damien\u2019s love for the beach takes him to the shore. He\u2019s not just a beach enthusiast; he\u2019s also a car fanatic who can be found revving up the excitement at car shows. But his interests don\u2019t end there; Damien also finds solace in the pages of comic books and the vibrant world of anime. His favorite superhero? None other than the friendly neighborhood Spider-Man!<\/p>\n<p>DJ Damien isn\u2019t just about music; he\u2019s about creating memories. With his boundless energy, eclectic taste, and inclusive spirit, he\u2019s your partner in ensuring that every beat, every lyric, and every moment of your event is nothing short of spectacular. Get ready to dance, groove, and celebrate life with the one and only DJ Damien!\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/15.0\/1f57a\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd7a\" data-emoji=\"\ud83d\udd7a\" aria-label=\"\ud83d\udd7a\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/15.0\/1f389\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf89\" data-emoji=\"\ud83c\udf89\" aria-label=\"\ud83c\udf89\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/15.0\/1f3b6\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" data-emoji=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" aria-label=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hailing from the vibrant coastal city of Virginia Beach, VA, meet the one and only DJ Damien. This musical virtuoso thrives on the electrifying energy of a lively crowd when he\u2019s on the decks. He\u2019s not just a DJ; he\u2019s a conductor of good times, making every event an unforgettable experience. With a diverse range&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18479","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - http